OL,3,GNEWSAWoman fined after breaching
OL,4,A10-year animal ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman already banned from keeping
OL,7,Fanimals admitted breaching a court
OL,8,Forder after cats and kittens were found
OL,9,Fhidden in her back garden.
OL,11,FNatasha Walker, 34, was given the
OL,12,F10-year ban by magistrates in July 2024
OL,13,Fafter a rabbit, puppy and dog were
OL,14,Ffound living in dirty conditions with
OL,15,Finadequate access to drinking water the
OL,16,Fyear before.
OL,18,FBut Slough Borough Council's officers
OL,19,Fentered Walker's home with a warrant in
OL,20,FJuly 2025 and found two cats and three
OL,21,Fkittens hidden behind a trampoline.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
